---
title: "refund (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_refunded: contract not paused
    q_check_refunded --> q_revert_dup: position.hasRefunded == true
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert AlreadyRefunded
    q_check_refunded --> q_check_window: not yet refunded
    q_check_window --> q_revert_expired: block.timestamp > lastInvestTimestamp + refundPeriodSeconds
    q_revert_expired --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodExpired
    q_check_window --> q_get_amount: within per-investor refund window
    q_get_amount --> q_update: amount = position.investedCapital
    q_update --> q_transfer: position.hasRefunded = true, totalCapitalInvested -= amount
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, amount), emit Refunded

    note right of q_check_window
        INV-001: refund window is per-investor (14 days from last investment)
        INV-002: each investor has independent refund deadline
    end note

    note right of q_update
        INV-003: state update before transfer (reentrancy protection)
        INV-004: full invested capital returned
    end note
